"Publish dev trpg databases in named pre-made states for rapid playtesting, selectable via po publish actions. Design decision (over a special initialization reducer): bundles are COMPOSITIONS of real production flows (publish, bootstrap_admin, password claim + rotation, admin-gated pushes, admin provisioning), so dev databases only contain states the production reducers can produce and the prod module ships nothing dev-only. Implemented: web-trpg/scripts/dev-publish.ts with bundles bare/seeded/combat/mapgen + po processes publish-dev-*; admin-gated provision_account (claimable account: password + player, no identity) and grant_role reducers; non-bare bundles provision dev/dev with the admin role since the script's admin identity evaporates on exit. Extend by adding scenario packs (shared with e2e testAssets) and bundle entries."